{"id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-use.md","title":"Oracle 计算的查询上界 use","display":"df-use — Oracle 计算的查询上界 use","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-use","aliases":["20-df-use"],"display":"df-use — Oracle 计算的查询上界 use","chapter":"3","section":"3.2–3.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 3.2.2(ii)；Remark 3.2.5；Theorem 3.3.9","source_printed_pages":[53,54,57],"source_pdf_pages":[89,90,93],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-use"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-use</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-use — Oracle 计算的查询上界 use"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2–3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.2.2(ii)；Remark 3.2.5；Theorem 3.3.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>90</span><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,u\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,u\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(i)=(q_i,t_i,h_i)\">\\(c(i)=(q_i,t_i,h_i)\\)</span> 为 oracle 停止历史的坐标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{e,q}\">\\(Q_{e,q}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e\">\\(M_e\\)</span> 的查询状态集。use 是部分函数，只在相应计算停止时定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}use}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):=\\{\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i):i&lt;|c|\\land q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\},\\\\\nQ_{e,A,x}:=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\},\\\\\nu_e^A(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\n\\land u=\\max(\\{z+1:z\\in\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\}\\cup\\{0\\})],\\\\\nu_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow\\land u_e^{A_\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=u.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}use}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):=\\{\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i):i&lt;|c|\\land q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\},\\\\\nQ_{e,A,x}:=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\},\\\\\nu_e^A(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\n\\land u=\\max(\\{z+1:z\\in\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\}\\cup\\{0\\})],\\\\\nu_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow\\land u_e^{A_\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=u.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u_e^X(x)\\simeq u_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u_e^X(x)\\simeq u_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>use 在发散计算上未定义；所有查询严格小于 use。本目录有限查询机器的 use 取最大查询数加 1，适配半开前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\upharpoonright u\">\\(A\\upharpoonright u\\)</span>。原书有扫描位置约定，基础记号在 §3.2 引入；3.3.9 实际是 Use Principle 定理，旧来源把它写成 Definition 3.3.9，现订正。更换模型或 use 约定须同步检查 ibT 边界，不把不同位置约定自动当作逐点相等。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.2.2(ii)；Remark 3.2.5；Theorem 3.3.9；印刷页 53, 54, 57；PDF 第 89, 90, 93 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,u\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"c(i)=(q_i,t_i,h_i)","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{e,q}","display":false},{"tex":"M_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}use}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):=\\{\\operatorname{num}(t_i,h_i):i<|c|\\land q_i\\in Q_{e,q}\\},\\\\\nQ_{e,A,x}:=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\},\\\\\nu_e^A(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\ [\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\n\\land u=\\max(\\{z+1:z\\in\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\}\\cup\\{0\\})],\\\\\nu_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow\\land u_e^{A_\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=u.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"u_e^X(x)\\simeq u_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\upharpoonright u","display":false}],"bytes":2042,"backlinks":[{"id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。"},{"id":"c7d3b5746093d796","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"a2e45aeae7b65467","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]。"},{"id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"364ab8ad1d9d7918","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-total-functional-reduction]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"c4e71acf1bfafb59","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-truth-table]]。"},{"id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"d467a7b6bbdb1c63","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding]]；see [[20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-use]] — 章 3；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]"}],"outgoing":["140cce30ee9c16d1"]}